<title>NETHERLANDS: Rodamco sees H2 clearly higher than H1.</title>
<headline>Rodamco sees H2 clearly higher than H1.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property investment fund Rodamco NV said it expected a net profit per share in the second half of the financial year 1996/97 which would clearly exceed the 1.30 guilders posted in the first half of the year.</p>
</text>
